exports[`ImportRateTableModal (caracterización) > con filas con problemas o claves repetidas exige reconocerlo 1`] = `"<div class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 flex items-center justify-center z-50 p-4"><div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-xl w-full max-w-4xl max-h-[92vh] overflow-y-auto"><div class="sticky top-0 bg-white flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 z-10"><div><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800">Importar filas de <span class="font-mono text-teal-700">ZONAS</span></h2><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">El archivo necesita una columna por cada variable de la clave, más el importe.</p></div><button class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 cursor-pointer" aria-label="Cerrar"><i class="ri-close-line text-xl"></i></button></div><div class="px-6 py-5 space-y-5"><div><label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Archivo</label><input accept=".csv,.xlsx,.xls,.txt" class="block w-full text-sm text-slate-600 file:mr-3 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-medium file:bg-teal-50 file:text-teal-700 hover:file:bg-teal-100 file:cursor-pointer" type="file"><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5"><i class="ri-file-line mr-1"></i>tarifas.csv</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Fila de encabezado</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="0">Fila 1</option><option value="1">Fila 2</option><option value="2">Fila 3</option><option value="3">Fila 4</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Formato de los números</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="auto">Automático</option><option value="es">Español — 1.234,56</option><option value="en">Inglés — 1,234.56</option></select></div></div><div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">Qué columna es cada cosa</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">Una columna de la clave sin asignar queda en comodín (<code class="font-mono">*</code>) en todas las filas.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Zona de origen</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="">Sin asignar</option><option value="0">1 · Origen</option><option value="1">2 · Destino</option><option value="2">3 · Importe</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Zona de destino</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="">Sin asignar</option><option value="0">1 · Origen</option><option value="1">2 · Destino</option><option value="2">3 · Importe</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Importe *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="">Sin asignar</option><option value="0">1 · Origen</option><option value="1">2 · Destino</option><option value="2">3 · Importe</option></select></div></div></div><div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Qué hacer con las filas que ya tiene el tarifario</h3><div class="space-y-2"><label class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-1 text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500" type="radio" checked=""><span><strong>Actualizar</strong> — se conservan las que están y se pisa el importe de las que coincidan en clave.<span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">Es lo que se quiere al recibir una lista de correcciones.</span></span></label><label class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-1 text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500" type="radio"><span><strong>Reemplazar todo</strong> — se borran todas las filas actuales y queda solo lo del archivo.<span class="block text-xs text-slate-500">Es lo que se quiere al recibir el tarifario nuevo completo.</span></span></label></div></div><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Vista previa</h3><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 px-2.5 py-1 text-sm ">2 filas</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 px-2.5 py-1 text-sm ">1 con problemas</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-700 px-2.5 py-1 text-sm ">1 clave repetida</span></div><label class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 mb-3 cursor-pointer"><input class="mt-1 text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500" type="checkbox"><span><strong>Entendido:</strong> el archivo tiene filas con problemas o claves repetidas. Deseo continuar.</span></label><div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-800 text-xs rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mb-3"><i class="ri-alert-line mr-1"></i>El archivo repite estas combinaciones: CCS | MCBO. Va a quedar la<strong> última</strong> de cada una: dos filas con la misma clave son igual de específicas y el motor elegiría una por orden.</div><div class="overflow-x-auto border border-slate-200 rounded-lg max-h-64 overflow-y-auto"><table class="w-full text-xs"><thead class="sticky top-0 bg-slate-50"><tr class="text-left text-slate-500 uppercase"><th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">Zona de origen</th><th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">Zona de destino</th><th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium text-right">Importe</th><th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">En el archivo</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100"><tr><td class="py-1.5 px-3 font-mono">CCS</td><td class="py-1.5 px-3 font-mono">MCBO</td><td class="py-1.5 px-3 text-right font-medium text-slate-800">10</td><td class="py-1.5 px-3 text-slate-400">10</td></tr><tr><td class="py-1.5 px-3 font-mono">CCS</td><td class="py-1.5 px-3 font-mono">MCBO</td><td class="py-1.5 px-3 text-right font-medium text-slate-800">11</td><td class="py-1.5 px-3 text-slate-400">11</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="mt-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-3"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-amber-800 mb-1">Filas que no se van a importar</p><ul class="text-xs text-amber-700 space-y-0.5"><li>Fila 4 (CCS | CCS): El importe "abc" no es un número.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sticky bottom-0 bg-white flex justify-end gap-2 px-6 py-4 border-t border-slate-200"><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm ">Cancelar</button><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md px-4 py-2 text-sm " disabled=""><i class="ri-upload-2-line mr-1"></i>Importar 2 filas</button></div></div></div>"`;

